FotoAutomat includes machine learning models from MediaPipe by Google LLC:
- BlazeFace (Full Range) face detection model
- Face Mesh V2 face landmarks model (from the MediaPipe Face Landmarker task)

Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE in this folder).
Source: https://github.com/google-ai-edge/mediapipe

Modifications: the original TensorFlow Lite models were converted to ONNX format
with tf2onnx (opset 13). Weights and architecture are otherwise unchanged.
